{"speciesId":378,"names":{"fr":"Regice","es":"Regice","en":"Regice","ja":"レジアイス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"REGICE’s body was made during an ice age. The deep-frozen body can’t be melted, even by fire. This POKéMON controls frigid air of minus 328 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"REGICE cloaks itself with frigid air of negative 328 degrees F. Things will freeze solid just by going near this POKéMON. Its icy body is so cold, it will not melt even if it is immersed in magma."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its entire body is made of Antarctic ice. After extensive studies, researchers believe the ice was formed during an ice age."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Research revealed that its body is made of the same kind of ice that is found at the South Pole."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Research revealed that its body is made of the same kind of ice that is found at the South Pole."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is said to have slept in a glacier for thousands of years. Its body can’t be melted, even by magma."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is said to have slept in a glacier for thousands of years. Its body can’t be melted, even by magma."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps est fait de glace datant de l’ère glaciaire. Il contrôle un air gelé de -200 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est fait de glace datant de l’ère glaciaire. Il contrôle un air gelé de -200 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il reposait dans un glacier depuis des milliers d’années. Même le magma ne peut pas le faire fondre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Dicen que ha yacido durmiendo en un glaciar durante milenios. Ni el magma puede derretir su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is said to have slept in a glacier for thousands of years. Its body can’t be melted, even by magma."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"氷河の 中で 数千年 眠っていたと 言われている。 マグマでも 体は 溶けない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est fait de glace datant de l’ère glaciaire. Il contrôle un air gelé de -200 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cuerpo está hecho con hielo de la glaciación. Controla aire gélido a -200 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"氷河期に できた 氷で 体が 作られている。 マイナス２００度の 冷気を 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps de Regice fut créé pendant l’ère glaciaire. Son corps est tellement gelé qu’il ne peut pas fondre, même en le brûlant. Ce Pokémon peut contrôler l’air glacé jusqu’à une température de -200 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Regice surgió durante la edad de hielo. El cuerpo de este Pokémon está totalmente congelado, ni siquiera el fuego puede derretirlo. Regice libera y regula un aire gélido de -200 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Regice’s body was made during an ice age. The deep-frozen body can’t be melted, even by fire. This Pokémon controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"氷河時代に つくられた 氷の 体は 炎でも 溶かす ことが できない。 マイナス ２００度の 冷気を 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Regice se recouvre d’air glacé à -200 °C. Tout ce qui passe à proximité de ce Pokémon gèle sur place. Son corps est si froid qu’il ne fond jamais, même s’il plonge dans du magma."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Regice se rodea de un aire gélido que llega a -200 °C y deja congelado a todo lo que se le acerca. Es imposible derretir a este Pokémon; tiene una temperatura demasiado baja."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Regice cloaks itself with frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit. Things will freeze solid just by going near this Pokémon. Its icy body is so cold, it will not melt even if it is immersed in magma."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"マイナス２００度の 冷気が 体を 包む。 近づいた だけでも 凍りついて しまうぞ。 マグマでも 溶けない 氷の 体を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Regice gèle quiconque s’approche de lui en un instant avec de l’air glacé pouvant atteindre -200 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Usa corrientes de aire gélido de hasta -200 ºC para congelar en un instante a cualquiera que se le acerque."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"With cold air that can reach temperatures as low as −328 degrees Fahrenheit, Regice instantly freezes any creature that approaches it."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"マイナス２００度まで 冷えこむ 冷気を 操り 近づいたものを あっという間に 氷漬けにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon de l’ère glaciaire dont le corps est entièrement composé d’eau gelée serait né sous une épaisse couche de glace."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Todo su cuerpo está compuesto de hielo. Se dice que surgió bajo una gruesa placa de hielo durante alguna glaciación."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon’s body is made of solid ice. It’s said that Regice was born beneath thick ice in the ice age."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"全身が 氷で できている。 氷河時代に ぶ厚い 氷の 下で 生まれたと いわれている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":378,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",18],[23,"level-up",18],[25,"level-up",18]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"level-up",73],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",73],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",73],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",73],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",73],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",73],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",43],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",43],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",43],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",24],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",24],[23,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",24],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[